"그래서, 충성스러운 직원들은 버려 두고 그 쓸모없는 여자랑 둘이 도망쳤단 말이야?","commandCount":64,"url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/terabraincs/terabraincs.github.io/main/public/story/reader/scenes/HORIZON_ACT4_STAGE1_END.json","position":"after","label":"후편"}],"layout":{"slot":0,"kind":"battle","width":350,"height":110,"visualWidth":468,"visualHeight":228,"x":475,"y":438,"connectors":[]}},{"id":31101042,"strId":"STAGE_SIDESTORY_31101042","act":4,"index":2,"uiNumber":2,"title":"복리이자","description":"퓨처 앳 워는 전쟁 중에 이미 첨단 군사 기술을 둘러싼 국제 분쟁의 중심지였다. 차등적인 기술 제공과 엠버 소장의 조율 덕분에 형태나마 어렵게 유지했다는 것이 오늘날의 분석이다.","characterId":"","characterSpine":null,"nodeKind":"battle","cutscenes":[{"id":"HORIZON_ACT4_STAGE2_START","title":"제프티 바이오테크, 방호 구축 실험지구.\n윌버 웨이틀리 대표, 시설 방문 중","commandCount":144,"url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/terabraincs/terabraincs.github.io/main/public/story/reader/scenes/HORIZON_ACT4_STAGE2_START.json","position":"before","label":"전편"},{"id":"HORIZON_ACT4_STAGE2_END","title":"대표님! 이, 이러다 실험체가 당하겠습니다!","commandCount":103,"url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/terabraincs/terabraincs.github.io/main/public/story/reader/scenes/HORIZON_ACT4_STAGE2_END.json","position":"after","label":"후편"}],"layout":{"slot":1,"kind":"battle","width":350,"height":110,"visualWidth":468,"visualHeight":228,"x":1065,"y":438,"connectors":[{"name":"LINE_CENTER","left":620.8,"top":413,"width":300,"height":50,"angle":0,"originX":1,"originY":0.5}]}},{"id":31101043,"strId":"STAGE_SIDESTORY_31101043","act":4,"index":3,"uiNumber":3,"title":"교향악단","description":"퓨처 앳 워 결성의 중심이었던 엠버 소장을 위험 인물로 평가하는 것은 당시 시대상으로 봤을 때 전혀 무리가 아니었다. 현재 밝혀진 암살 미수 사건은 127건으로, 이외 납치 시도나 포섭 공작 등을 고려하면 그녀가 잠적을 택한 배경도 쉽게 이해할 수 있을 것이다.","characterId":"","characterSpine":null,"nodeKind":"battle","cutscenes":[{"id":"HORIZON_ACT4_STAGE3_START","title":"제프티 바이오테크 특무함 코러스, 대표 전용 휴게실.\n윌버 웨이틀리 대표, 데이트 중","commandCount":136,"url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/terabraincs/terabraincs.github.io/main/public/story/reader/scenes/HORIZON_ACT4_STAGE3_START.json","position":"before","label":"전편"},{"id":"HORIZON_ACT4_STAGE3_END","title":"하아. 벌써 우리 둘만 남았네. 원본부터 조잡한 잡종들이라 어쩔 수 없나.","commandCount":81,"url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/terabraincs/terabraincs.github.io/main/public/story/reader/scenes/HORIZON_ACT4_STAGE3_END.json","position":"after","label":"후편"}],"layout":{"slot":2,"kind":"battle","width":350,"height":110,"visualWidth":468,"visualHeight":228,"x":1655,"y":438,"connectors":[{"name":"LINE_CENTER","left":1210.8,"top":413,"width":300,"height":50,"angle":0,"originX":1,"originY":0.5}]}},{"id":31101044,"strId":"STAGE_SIDESTORY_31101044","act":4,"index":4,"uiNumber":11,"title":"인터루드 #10","description":"오차 범위 내에서 형제자매들보다 늦게 기동했을 때, 그들이 자멸하기 전 남겼던 단말마를 기억한다.\n살고 싶지 않아. 어째서 우릴 만든 거예요.","characterId":"NKM_UNIT_HORIZON_M_LOAN","characterSpine":{"id":"illustration/ab_unit_illust_nkm_unit_horizon_m_loan/UNIT_ILLUST_HORIZON_M_LOAN/UNIT_ILLUST_HORIZON_M_LOAN","jsonUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/terabraincs/Asset_spine/main/spine/illustration/ab_unit_illust_nkm_unit_horizon_m_loan/UNIT_ILLUST_HORIZON_M_LOAN/UNIT_ILLUST_HORIZON_M_LOAN.json","atlasUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/terabraincs/Asset_spine/main/spine/illustration/ab_unit_illust_nkm_unit_horizon_m_loan/UNIT_ILLUST_HORIZON_M_LOAN/UNIT_ILLUST_HORIZON_M_LOAN.atlas","textureUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/terabraincs/Asset_spine/main/spine/illustration/ab_unit_illust_nkm_unit_horizon_m_loan/UNIT_ILLUST_HORIZON_M_LOAN/UNIT_ILLUST_HORIZON_M_LOAN.png","defaultMix":0.2,"skeletonScale":0.01,"layout":{"x":-83,"y":364,"scaleX":0.30626053,"scaleY":0.30626053,"rotation":0,"flipX":false,"flipY":false}},"characterSkinName":"default","nodeKind":"story","cutscenes":[{"id":"HORIZON_ACT4_INTERLUDE1","title":"수심 15. 21. 30. 40. 55. 60. 65. 69…….","commandCount":108,"url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/terabraincs/terabraincs.github.io/main/public/story/reader/scenes/HORIZON_ACT4_INTERLUDE1.json","position":"before","label":"전편"}],"layout":{"slot":3,